                  "cwe/CWE-923",
                  "mitre/T1046",
                  "mitre/T1210",
                  "network",
                  "pack:k8s-network",
                  "security",
                  "segmentation",
                  "stride/E",
                  "stride/I",
                  "stride/S",
                  "stride/T"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "precision": "very-high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "TF-NET-007",
              "name": "LoadbalancerServiceHasNoSourceIpRestriction",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "LoadBalancer Service has no source IP restriction"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Service shop/storefront provisions a cloud load balancer with no loadBalancerSourceRanges, so it is reachable from the entire internet. This bypasses the ingress controller and therefore also bypasses any WAF, authentication, or rate limiting configured there."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Service shop/storefront provisions a cloud load balancer with no loadBalancerSourceRanges, so it is reachable from the entire internet. This bypasses the ingress controller and therefore also bypasses any WAF, authentication, or rate limiting configured there. **Remediation:** Restrict source ranges, or move the workload behind the ingress controller. ```yaml spec: type: LoadBalancer loadBalancerSourceRanges: - 203.0.113.0/24 ``` CWE: CWE-284 \u00b7 MITRE: T1133 \u00b7 NIST: SC-7, AC-4 \u00b7 OWASP: K05",
                "markdown": "Service shop/storefront provisions a cloud load balancer with no loadBalancerSourceRanges, so it is reachable from the entire internet. This bypasses the ingress controller and therefore also bypasses any WAF, authentication, or rate limiting configured there.\n\n**Remediation:** Restrict source ranges, or move the workload behind the ingress controller.\n\n```yaml\nspec:\n  type: LoadBalancer\n  loadBalancerSourceRanges:\n    - 203.0.113.0/24\n```\n\nCWE: CWE-284 \u00b7 MITRE: T1133 \u00b7 NIST: SC-7, AC-4 \u00b7 OWASP: K05"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
