            },
            {
              "id": "TF-CLOUD-007",
              "name": "HardcodedCredentialInTerraformSource",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Hardcoded credential in Terraform source"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "aws_db_instance shop has a credential-shaped attribute with a literal value. Terraform source is version-controlled, and any value here is also written in cleartext into the state file, which is frequently stored in a bucket with broader read access than the repository."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "aws_db_instance shop has a credential-shaped attribute with a literal value. Terraform source is version-controlled, and any value here is also written in cleartext into the state file, which is frequently stored in a bucket with broader read access than the repository. **Remediation:** Rotate the credential, move it to a secret manager, and encrypt remote state. ```yaml data \"aws_secretsmanager_secret_version\" \"db\" { secret_id = \"prod/db/password\" } # password = jsondecode(data.aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db.secret_string)[\"password\"] ``` CWE: CWE-798 \u00b7 MITRE: T1552.001 \u00b7 NIST: IA-5, SC-28",
                "markdown": "aws_db_instance shop has a credential-shaped attribute with a literal value. Terraform source is version-controlled, and any value here is also written in cleartext into the state file, which is frequently stored in a bucket with broader read access than the repository.\n\n**Remediation:** Rotate the credential, move it to a secret manager, and encrypt remote state.\n\n```yaml\ndata \"aws_secretsmanager_secret_version\" \"db\" {\n  secret_id = \"prod/db/password\"\n}\n# password = jsondecode(data.aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db.secret_string)[\"password\"]\n```\n\nCWE: CWE-798 \u00b7 MITRE: T1552.001 \u00b7 NIST: IA-5, SC-28"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "cloud",
                  "critical-path",
                  "cwe/CWE-798",
                  "mitre/T1552.001",
                  "pack:cloud-terraform",
                  "secrets",
                  "security",
