            {
              "id": "TF-DKR-004",
              "name": "RemoteContentFetchedWithAdd",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Remote content fetched with ADD"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "ADD with a URL downloads and unpacks remote content with no integrity check. If the upstream host is compromised or DNS is hijacked, arbitrary content lands in the image at build time -- a textbook supply chain injection point."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "ADD with a URL downloads and unpacks remote content with no integrity check. If the upstream host is compromised or DNS is hijacked, arbitrary content lands in the image at build time -- a textbook supply chain injection point. **Remediation:** Download explicitly and verify a checksum or signature. ```yaml RUN curl -fsSLO https://example.com/tool.tar.gz \\ && echo \"e3b0c442... tool.tar.gz\" | sha256sum -c - \\ && tar -xzf tool.tar.gz && rm tool.tar.gz ``` CWE: CWE-494, CWE-829 \u00b7 MITRE: T1195.002, T1105 \u00b7 CIS: 4.9 \u00b7 NIST: SI-7",
                "markdown": "ADD with a URL downloads and unpacks remote content with no integrity check. If the upstream host is compromised or DNS is hijacked, arbitrary content lands in the image at build time -- a textbook supply chain injection point.\n\n**Remediation:** Download explicitly and verify a checksum or signature.\n\n```yaml\nRUN curl -fsSLO https://example.com/tool.tar.gz \\\n && echo \"e3b0c442...  tool.tar.gz\" | sha256sum -c - \\\n && tar -xzf tool.tar.gz && rm tool.tar.gz\n```\n\nCWE: CWE-494, CWE-829 \u00b7 MITRE: T1195.002, T1105 \u00b7 CIS: 4.9 \u00b7 NIST: SI-7"
              },
