            {
              "id": "TF-DKR-006",
              "name": "ImageHasNoHealthcheck",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Image has no HEALTHCHECK"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Without a HEALTHCHECK, a container that has hung but not exited is indistinguishable from a healthy one outside Kubernetes (where probes cover this)."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Without a HEALTHCHECK, a container that has hung but not exited is indistinguishable from a healthy one outside Kubernetes (where probes cover this). **Remediation:** Add a HEALTHCHECK. ```yaml HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=3s --retries=3 \\ CMD wget -qO- http://localhost:8080/healthz || exit 1 ``` CWE: CWE-703 \u00b7 CIS: 4.6 \u00b7 NIST: SI-4",
                "markdown": "Without a HEALTHCHECK, a container that has hung but not exited is indistinguishable from a healthy one outside Kubernetes (where probes cover this).\n\n**Remediation:** Add a HEALTHCHECK.\n\n```yaml\nHEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=3s --retries=3 \\\n  CMD wget -qO- http://localhost:8080/healthz || exit 1\n```\n\nCWE: CWE-703 \u00b7 CIS: 4.6 \u00b7 NIST: SI-4"
              },
