            {
              "id": "TF-NET-012",
              "name": "NamespaceHasNoPodSecurityAdmissionEnforcement",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Namespace has no Pod Security Admission enforcement"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Namespace shop sets no pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce label. Nothing prevents someone deploying a privileged, host-mounting pod here tomorrow, which means every workload-level fix in this report can be silently undone."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Namespace shop sets no pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce label. Nothing prevents someone deploying a privileged, host-mounting pod here tomorrow, which means every workload-level fix in this report can be silently undone. **Remediation:** Label the namespace with a Pod Security Standard. ```yaml metadata: labels: pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: restricted pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce-version: latest pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: restricted pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: restricted ``` CWE: CWE-693 \u00b7 MITRE: T1610 \u00b7 CIS: 5.2.1 \u00b7 NIST: CM-7, AC-6 \u00b7 OWASP: K01",
                "markdown": "Namespace shop sets no pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce label. Nothing prevents someone deploying a privileged, host-mounting pod here tomorrow, which means every workload-level fix in this report can be silently undone.\n\n**Remediation:** Label the namespace with a Pod Security Standard.\n\n```yaml\nmetadata:\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce-version: latest\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: restricted\n```\n\nCWE: CWE-693 \u00b7 MITRE: T1610 \u00b7 CIS: 5.2.1 \u00b7 NIST: CM-7, AC-6 \u00b7 OWASP: K01"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
