              "id": "TF-DATA-008",
              "name": "NamespaceHasNoResourcequota",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Namespace has no ResourceQuota"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Namespace shop has no ResourceQuota, so a single runaway or malicious workload here can consume the cluster's entire allocatable capacity and starve every other tenant."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Namespace shop has no ResourceQuota, so a single runaway or malicious workload here can consume the cluster's entire allocatable capacity and starve every other tenant. **Remediation:** Add a ResourceQuota and a LimitRange with sane defaults. ```yaml apiVersion: v1 kind: ResourceQuota metadata: {name: default-quota, namespace: {{ name }}} spec: hard: requests.cpu: \"20\" requests.memory: 40Gi limits.cpu: \"40\" limits.memory: 80Gi pods: \"100\" ``` CWE: CWE-770 \u00b7 MITRE: T1496, T1499 \u00b7 CIS: 5.7.1 \u00b7 NIST: SC-5 \u00b7 OWASP: K07",
                "markdown": "Namespace shop has no ResourceQuota, so a single runaway or malicious workload here can consume the cluster's entire allocatable capacity and starve every other tenant.\n\n**Remediation:** Add a ResourceQuota and a LimitRange with sane defaults.\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ResourceQuota\nmetadata: {name: default-quota, namespace: {{ name }}}\nspec:\n  hard:\n    requests.cpu: \"20\"\n    requests.memory: 40Gi\n    limits.cpu: \"40\"\n    limits.memory: 80Gi\n    pods: \"100\"\n```\n\nCWE: CWE-770 \u00b7 MITRE: T1496, T1499 \u00b7 CIS: 5.7.1 \u00b7 NIST: SC-5 \u00b7 OWASP: K07"
              },
